title: "Reproducible EEG Motor Imagery Classification Using CNN-LSTM Deep Learning"
abstract: "Reproducible EEG motor-imagery classification using the PhysioNet EEG Motor Movement/Imagery Dataset, subject-independent evaluation, CNN-LSTM models, and optional GAN-based augmentation."
